#: includes/admin/upgrades/1.2.8.php:117
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will migrate all user earnings and logs "
"with their meta data to a new custom database table. This upgrade provides "
"better performance and scalability."
msgstr ""
"<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>"
"更新，會將所有使用者收入和日誌及其元資料遷移至新的自訂資料庫表。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。"

#: includes/admin/upgrades/1.4.7.php:112
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all logs with new database "
"table fields. This upgrade provides better performance and scalability."
msgstr ""
"<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>"
"更新，會以新的資料庫表欄位更新所有日誌。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。"

#: includes/admin/upgrades/1.5.1.php:109
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all requirements "
"relationships (achievements and their steps, points types and their "
"automatic awards and deducts, ranks and their requirements)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>更新，將會更新所有需求關係 "
"(成就及其步驟、點數類型及其自動獎勵和扣除、等級及其需求)。"

#: includes/admin/upgrades/1.4.3.php:112
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all user earnings with new "
"database table fields. This upgrade provides better performance and "
"scalability."
msgstr ""
"<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>"
"更新，會以新的資料庫表欄位更新所有使用者收入。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。"

#: includes/admin/upgrades/6.9.4.php:112
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will update the GamiPress logs adding "
"some extra information on them to improve database queries."
msgstr ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>"
"更新，將更新GamiPress日誌，增加一些額外的資訊，以改善資料庫查詢。"

#: includes/admin/upgrades/2.3.7.php:107
msgid ""
"<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>"
"mandatory</em></strong> update that will update the GamiPress user earnings "
"adding some extra information on earnings related to requirements."
msgstr ""
"<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>"
"更新，將更新GamiPress用戶的收益，增加一些額外的收益相關要求的信息。"

#: includes/admin/contextual-help.php:95
