#: includes/admin/tools/recount-activity.php:63
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> If the recount process fails, try to reduce this "
"setting to a lower number to 50, 20 or 10 entries per loop."
msgstr "<strong>注意：</strong>如果重新計數過程失敗，請嘗試將此設定降低到較低的數字，例如每個循環 50、20 或 10 個項目。"

#: includes/admin/tools/recount-activity.php:48
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> Some activity may not be possible to recount (like "
"user log ins or daily visits) because there are not registries stored in the "
"database."
msgstr "<strong>注意：</strong>有些活動可能無法重新計算（例如使用者登入或每日造訪），因為資料庫中沒有儲存註冊資料。"

#: includes/admin/meta-boxes/achievements.php:108
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> This limit decides how many times this achievement "
"can be earned on your site. Setting it to 10, for example, will limit this "
"achievement to only the first 10 users who achieve it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>注意：</strong>此限制決定在您的網站上可以獲得此成就的次數。例如，設定為 10 會限制此成就僅限於前 10 位取得此成就的使用者。"

